<title>GREECE: TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, FEB 25.</title>
<headline>TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, FEB 25.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Greece's fixing rates</p>
<p>for leading currencies on Tuesday were as follows.</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Currency:	Feb 25	Feb 24     Dec 31 96    NET</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>- USD =	  261.840     262.420     247.020    6.00 %</p>
<p>- ECU =	  303.520     303.710     306.830   -1.08 %</p>
<p>- DEM =	  156.290     156.660     158.970   -1.69 %</p>
<p>- FRF =	   46.330	46.398	47.182   -1.81 %</p>
<p>- GBP =	  428.800     427.300     419.180    2.29 %</p>
<p>- NLG =	  139.030     139.370     141.685   -1.87 %</p>
<p>- ITL (100) =   15.713	15.806	16.185   -2.92 %</p>
<p>- JPY (100) =  214.650     214.580     212.430    1.05 %</p>
<p>- ESP =	    1.846	 1.852	 1.888   -2.22 %</p>
<p>- PTE =	    1.557	 1.560	 1.581   -1.52 %</p>
<p>- CHF =	  179.330     179.845     183.135   -2.08 %</p>
<p>Note: The percentage net change is calculated as the percentage</p>
<p>difference between the most recent fixing rate and the December</p>
<p>31, 1996 rate.</p>
<p>--Margarita Sotiropoulou, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
